# You design and build LEGO Technic models one step at a time, in a build language.
# 
# For each step you write:
# ADD name partnumber color
# CONNECT part.point -> part.point LOCKED|TURNS|STIFF   (points: hole1.., axlehole1.., pin1.., axle1.., clip1..; LOCKED = cross in cross, turn together; TURNS = free; STIFF = friction pin)
# Optional: MESH a.teeth b.teeth / RATIO a b x/y / GROUP g (opens a side build) / END (closes it) / ATTACH g (joins a finished side build into the main model)
# WHY one plain sentence: what this step builds and what it is for.
# A point ending in ~ is an estimate; ? means not known.
# 
# Rules: only use real points of each part; a round pin never goes in a cross hole; a shaft that must turn needs round holes; a worm needs stops on both sides; gears must sit at the right distance.
STEP 1
ADD chassis-crossbeam-1 32316 white
ADD chassis-longpin-1 42924 blue
ADD chassis-longpin-2 42924 blue
CONNECT chassis-longpin-1.pin1 -> chassis-crossbeam-1.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-2.pin1 -> chassis-crossbeam-1.hole4 STIFF
WHY Places two long pins two holes apart in the front crossbeam to hold the chassis core.
STEP 2
ADD chassis-core-1 14720 lightgray
CONNECT chassis-longpin-1.pin2 -> chassis-core-1.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-2.pin2 -> chassis-core-1.hole3~ STIFF
WHY Fastens the offset grey core to the crossbeam while leaving its middle clear for the mechanism.
STEP 3
ADD chassis-axlepin-1 43093 blue
ADD chassis-pinhub-1 65487 black
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-1.pin1 -> chassis-core-1.hole9~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pinhub-1.pin1 -> chassis-core-1.hole8~ STIFF
WHY Adds the rear locating axle pin and the upright bearing for the next cross pin.
STEP 4
ADD chassis-pinblock-1 65489 lightgray
ADD chassis-pinblock-2 65489 lightgray
CONNECT chassis-longpin-1.pin2 -> chassis-pinblock-1.hole2~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-2.pin2 -> chassis-pinblock-2.hole2~ STIFF
WHY Fits matching pin blocks over the front posts to provide the wheel and body attachment points.
STEP 5
ADD front-wheelpin-1 39888 tan
ADD front-wheelpin-2 39888 tan
CONNECT front-wheelpin-1.pin1 -> chassis-pinblock-1.hole1~ TURNS
CONNECT front-wheelpin-2.pin1 -> chassis-pinblock-2.hole1~ TURNS
WHY Adds frictionless wheel spindles so the front wheels will roll freely.
STEP 6
ADD chassis-crossbeam-2 32316 white
ADD chassis-longpin-3 42924 blue
CONNECT chassis-pinblock-1.pin3 -> chassis-crossbeam-2.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pinblock-2.pin3 -> chassis-crossbeam-2.hole5~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-3.pin2 -> chassis-pinhub-1.hole1 STIFF
WHY Caps the front pin blocks with a second crossbeam and installs the transverse rear mounting pin.
STEP 7
ADD chassis-cap-1 43857 black
ADD chassis-cap-2 43857 black
CONNECT chassis-longpin-1.pin3 -> chassis-cap-1.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-2.pin3 -> chassis-cap-2.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pinblock-1.pin4 -> chassis-cap-1.hole2~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pinblock-2.pin4 -> chassis-cap-2.hole2~ STIFF
WHY Locks the front posts and pin blocks together with two short caps.
STEP 8
GROUP chassis-side-left
ADD chassis-rail-1 32009 lightgray
ADD chassis-pin-1 61332 black
ADD chassis-pin-2 61332 black
ADD rear-wheelpin-1 39888 tan
ADD chassis-axlepin-2 43093 blue
ADD steering-bearing-1 32013 white
CONNECT chassis-pin-1.pin1 -> chassis-rail-1.hole8 STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pin-2.pin1 -> chassis-rail-1.hole6 STIFF
CONNECT rear-wheelpin-1.pin1 -> chassis-rail-1.hole7 TURNS
CONNECT rear-wheelpin-1.pin2 -> steering-bearing-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-2.axle1 -> chassis-rail-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH chassis-side-left
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-2.pin1 -> chassis-core-1.hole4~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-3.pin1 -> chassis-rail-1.hole1~ STIFF
WHY Adds the first bent chassis rail with a free rear wheel spindle and a bearing for the steering shaft.
STEP 9
GROUP lift-worm-shaft
ADD lift-worm-axle-1 15462 brown
ADD lift-worm-bearing-1 6536 red
CONNECT lift-worm-axle-1.axle1 -> lift-worm-bearing-1.hole1 TURNS
WHY Starts the lift drive with a stopped axle in a round bearing so the shaft can turn.
STEP 10
ADD lift-worm-1 32905 lightgray
ADD lift-worm-bearing-2 6536 red
CONNECT lift-worm-axle-1.axle2~ -> lift-worm-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT lift-worm-axle-1.axle4~ -> lift-worm-bearing-2.hole1 TURNS
WHY Traps the worm between two round bearings with both red cross holes facing the same way.
STEP 11
ADD lift-worm-handle-1 18948 white
CONNECT lift-worm-axle-1.axle5 -> lift-worm-handle-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Locks the white handle onto the worm shaft and retains the outer bearing against the worm.
STEP 12
ADD lift-worm-brace-1 18651 black
CONNECT lift-worm-brace-1.axle1 -> lift-worm-bearing-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
WHY Adds the transverse axle pin that will locate the rear worm bearing between the chassis rails.
STEP 13
ATTACH lift-worm-shaft
CONNECT lift-worm-brace-1.axle2 -> chassis-rail-1.hole5~ TURNS
WHY Seats the worm assembly along the chassis with its handle accessible at the rear.
STEP 14
ADD lift-bearing-crossaxle-1 15462 brown
CONNECT lift-bearing-crossaxle-1.axle1 -> chassis-rail-1.hole2~ TURNS
CONNECT lift-bearing-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> lift-worm-bearing-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Locates the front worm bearing on a stopped transverse axle while leaving the worm shaft free to turn.
STEP 15
ADD lift-output-axle-1 99008 tan
ADD lift-output-gear-1 10928 darkgray
CONNECT lift-output-axle-1.axle1 -> chassis-rail-1.hole3~ TURNS
CONNECT lift-output-axle-1.axle3~ -> lift-output-gear-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
MESH lift-worm-1.teeth lift-output-gear-1.teeth
WHY Meshes the eight-tooth output gear with the worm so turning the rear handle slowly raises or lowers the lift linkage.
STEP 16
GROUP steering-shaft
ADD steering-axle-1 3708 black
ADD steering-bearing-2 32013 white
CONNECT steering-axle-1.axle1 -> steering-bearing-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
WHY Builds the long steering shaft with a perpendicular round bearing at its front end.
STEP 17
ATTACH steering-shaft
CONNECT steering-axle-1.axle12~ -> steering-bearing-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Runs the long fork-leveling link along the chassis with its rear bearing on the rear wheel spindle.
STEP 18
GROUP chassis-side-right
ADD chassis-rail-2 32009 lightgray
ADD chassis-pin-3 61332 black
ADD chassis-pin-4 61332 black
ADD chassis-axlepin-3 11214 red
ADD steering-crossaxle-1 4519 lightgray
CONNECT steering-crossaxle-1.axle1 -> chassis-rail-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT chassis-pin-3.pin1 -> chassis-rail-2.hole8 STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pin-4.pin1 -> chassis-rail-2.hole6 STIFF
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-3.axle1 -> chassis-rail-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH chassis-side-right
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-3.pin1 -> chassis-core-1.hole6~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-longpin-3.pin3 -> chassis-rail-2.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT lift-bearing-crossaxle-1.axle5 -> chassis-rail-2.hole2~ TURNS
CONNECT lift-output-axle-1.axle3 -> chassis-rail-2.hole3~ TURNS
CONNECT lift-worm-brace-1.pin1 -> chassis-rail-2.hole5~ STIFF
CONNECT rear-wheelpin-1.pin3 -> chassis-rail-2.hole7 TURNS
WHY Closes the chassis with the second rail, capturing both lift shafts without locking their round bearings.
STEP 19
GROUP front-steering-crossaxle
ADD front-steering-axle-1 3707 black
ADD front-steering-connector-1 42003 white
ADD front-steering-lug-1 60483 white
ADD front-steering-bush-1 3713 lightgray
CONNECT front-steering-axle-1.axle1 -> front-steering-connector-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT front-steering-axle-1.axle2~ -> front-steering-lug-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT front-steering-axle-1.axle3~ -> front-steering-bush-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH front-steering-crossaxle
CONNECT front-steering-axle-1.axle4~ -> chassis-core-1.hole2~ TURNS
WHY Inserts the front steering cross axle with its white linkage connector and inner retaining bush.
STEP 20
ADD front-steering-bush-2 3713 lightgray
CONNECT front-steering-axle-1.axle8 -> front-steering-bush-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Retains the front steering cross axle from the other side so it cannot slide out of the chassis.
STEP 21
ADD cab-front-link-1 6632 black
ADD cab-front-link-2 6632 black
ADD cab-front-crossaxle-1 4519 lightgray
CONNECT cab-front-crossaxle-1.axle1~ -> cab-front-link-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-3.pin2 -> cab-front-link-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-front-crossaxle-1.axle3 -> cab-front-link-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-3.pin2 -> cab-front-link-2.hole1 STIFF
WHY Builds the paired front cab supports around the red friction pin with their upper cross axle level.
STEP 22
GROUP cab-inner-frame
ADD cab-arch-1 32250 black
ADD cab-upper-crossaxle-1 4519 lightgray
ADD cab-middle-crossaxle-1 4519 lightgray
CONNECT cab-upper-crossaxle-1.axle1 -> cab-arch-1.axlehole3 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-middle-crossaxle-1.axle1 -> cab-arch-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH cab-inner-frame
CONNECT cab-front-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> cab-arch-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
WHY Locks the inner cab frame to the front cab supports and adds two cross axles for its upper links.
STEP 23
GROUP cab-rocker
ADD cab-rocker-1 32056 black
ADD cab-rocker-arm-1 32449 black
ADD cab-rocker-crossaxle-1 4519 lightgray
ADD cab-rocker-crossaxle-2 4519 lightgray
ADD cab-rocker-crossaxle-3 4519 lightgray
ADD cab-rocker-bush-1 3713 lightgray
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-1.axle1 -> cab-rocker-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-2.axle1 -> cab-rocker-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-2.axle2~ -> cab-rocker-arm-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-3.axle2~ -> cab-rocker-arm-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-3.axle3 -> cab-rocker-bush-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH cab-rocker
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-1.axle1~ -> cab-arch-1.hole4 TURNS
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-2.axle1~ -> cab-arch-1.hole2 TURNS
WHY Adds the L-shaped cab support and its shorter arm inside the cab frame.
STEP 24
ADD lift-lower-lug-1 6536 red
CONNECT lift-bearing-crossaxle-1.axle5 -> lift-lower-lug-1.hole1 TURNS
WHY Fits the lower steering lug over the transverse axle with its cross hole facing upward.
STEP 25
ADD lift-rod-axle-1 4519 lightgray
ADD lift-rod-joiner-1 59443 lightgray
ADD lift-rod-joiner-2 59443 lightgray
ADD lift-rod-axle-2 32062 red
CONNECT lift-rod-axle-1.axle1 -> lift-lower-lug-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT lift-rod-axle-1.axle2~ -> lift-rod-joiner-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT lift-rod-axle-2.axle1 -> lift-rod-joiner-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT lift-rod-axle-2.axle2 -> lift-rod-joiner-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Builds the upright steering shaft from two axle joiners locked to the lower red connector.
STEP 26
ADD cab-spacer-1 60483 darktan
ADD cab-spacer-2 60483 darktan
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-2.axle2~ -> cab-spacer-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-3.axle2~ -> cab-spacer-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Spaces the cab linkage with two tan lugs while leaving their round holes available.
STEP 27
ADD cab-roof-link-1 6632 black
ADD cab-roof-connector-1 32184 black
CONNECT cab-upper-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> cab-roof-link-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> cab-roof-link-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-upper-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> cab-roof-connector-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> cab-roof-connector-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
WHY Bridges the upper cross axles with the roof link and its perpendicular bearing block.
STEP 28
GROUP underside-brace
ADD chassis-bottom-beam-1 32524 black
ADD chassis-bottom-lug-1 60483 white
ADD chassis-bottom-pin-1 3673 lightgray
CONNECT chassis-bottom-pin-1.pin1 -> chassis-bottom-lug-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT chassis-bottom-pin-1.pin2 -> chassis-bottom-beam-1.hole1 TURNS
END
ATTACH underside-brace
CONNECT chassis-pinblock-1.pin2~ -> chassis-bottom-beam-1.hole7~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pinblock-2.pin2~ -> chassis-bottom-beam-1.hole5~ STIFF
CONNECT lift-bearing-crossaxle-1.axle5~ -> chassis-bottom-lug-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Adds the long underside brace with a hinged white lug beneath the cab linkage.
STEP 29
ADD cab-front-link-3 6632 black
ADD cab-front-link-4 6632 black
CONNECT cab-front-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-front-link-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-3.pin2 -> cab-front-link-3.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-front-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-front-link-4.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT chassis-axlepin-3.pin2 -> cab-front-link-4.hole1 STIFF
WHY Thickens the front cab supports on the same friction pin without changing their spacing.
STEP 30
ADD cab-rocker-2 32056 black
ADD cab-roof-link-2 6632 black
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-1.axle3 -> cab-roof-link-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-upper-crossaxle-1.axle3 -> cab-roof-link-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-3.axle3~ -> cab-rocker-2.axlehole3 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-2.axle3 -> cab-rocker-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-middle-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-rocker-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
WHY Closes the outer rocker and roof links around the exposed cross axles.
STEP 31
ADD cab-arch-2 32250 black
ADD cab-rear-link-1 32449 black
CONNECT cab-front-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-arch-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-upper-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-arch-2.axlehole3 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-middle-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-arch-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-1.axle3~ -> cab-rear-link-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-rocker-crossaxle-3.axle3~ -> cab-rear-link-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
WHY Finishes the outer cab frame and the straight rear link to keep the moving assembly aligned.
STEP 32
ADD steering-knob-axle-1 4519 lightgray
ADD steering-knob-gear-1 32270 black
CONNECT steering-knob-axle-1.axle2~ -> cab-roof-connector-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT steering-knob-axle-1.axle1~ -> lift-rod-joiner-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT steering-knob-axle-1.axle3 -> steering-knob-gear-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Adds the roof-mounted knob and its vertical shaft through the roof bearing into the upright rod.
STEP 33
GROUP cab-lower-trim
ADD cab-trim-1 32449 mediumazure
ADD cab-trim-2 32449 mediumazure
ADD cab-trim-spacer-1 18654 white
ADD cab-trim-axlepin-1 43093 blue
ADD cab-trim-pin-1 61332 black
ADD cab-trim-pin-2 61332 black
ADD cab-trim-connector-1 42003 white
CONNECT cab-trim-axlepin-1.pin1 -> cab-trim-spacer-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-axlepin-1.axle1 -> cab-trim-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-trim-axlepin-1.axle1 -> cab-trim-2.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-trim-pin-1.pin1 -> cab-trim-2.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-pin-2.pin1 -> cab-trim-2.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-pin-1.pin2 -> cab-trim-connector-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-pin-2.pin2 -> cab-trim-connector-1.hole2 STIFF
END
ATTACH cab-lower-trim
CONNECT front-steering-axle-1.axle8~ -> cab-trim-connector-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Builds the blue-and-white lower cab trim and attaches it below the front cab frame.
STEP 34
ADD rear-side-beam-1 32526 mediumazure
ADD rear-wheelpin-2 39888 tan
CONNECT rear-wheelpin-2.pin1 -> rear-side-beam-1.hole1~ TURNS
CONNECT chassis-pin-3.pin2 -> rear-side-beam-1.hole7~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pin-4.pin2 -> rear-side-beam-1.hole3~ STIFF
WHY Covers the rear chassis side with an L-shaped blue beam and adds the second free wheel spindle.
STEP 35
ADD boom-main-beam-1 41239 mediumazure
CONNECT steering-crossaxle-1.axle2~ -> boom-main-beam-1.hole1 TURNS
WHY Mounts the thirteen-hole lifting boom on the rear transverse pivot axle.
STEP 36
ADD rear-side-beam-2 32526 mediumazure
ADD rear-wheelpin-3 39888 tan
CONNECT rear-wheelpin-3.pin1 -> rear-side-beam-2.hole1~ TURNS
CONNECT chassis-pin-1.pin2 -> rear-side-beam-2.hole7~ STIFF
CONNECT chassis-pin-2.pin2 -> rear-side-beam-2.hole3~ STIFF
WHY Completes the opposite blue rear side and its free wheel spindle.
STEP 37
GROUP boom-lift-link
ADD boom-link-1 32063 white
ADD boom-link-2 32063 white
ADD boom-link-pin-1 3673 lightgray
CONNECT boom-link-pin-1.pin1 -> boom-link-1.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT boom-link-pin-1.pin1~ -> boom-link-2.hole1 TURNS
WHY Starts the doubled white boom link on a frictionless hinge pin.
STEP 38
ADD boom-link-pin-2 3673 lightgray
CONNECT boom-link-pin-2.pin1 -> boom-link-1.hole6 TURNS
CONNECT boom-link-pin-2.pin1~ -> boom-link-2.hole6 TURNS
WHY Pins the far ends of the paired white links together while leaving the projecting end free for a hinge.
STEP 39
ADD boom-crank-1 32056 black
ADD boom-crank-2 32056 black
CONNECT boom-link-pin-2.pin2 -> boom-crank-1.hole2~ TURNS
CONNECT boom-link-pin-2.pin2 -> boom-crank-2.hole2~ TURNS
END
WHY Adds two black crank plates around the outer frictionless pin to carry the worm-driven lift motion.
STEP 40
ATTACH boom-lift-link
CONNECT boom-link-pin-1.pin2 -> boom-main-beam-1.hole4~ TURNS
CONNECT lift-output-axle-1.axle1 -> boom-crank-1.axlehole3~ LOCKED
CONNECT lift-output-axle-1.axle1 -> boom-crank-2.axlehole3~ LOCKED
WHY Joins the worm-driven crank to the boom through the white links so the boom can rise around its rear pivot.
STEP 41
ADD lift-handle-axle-1 32062 red
ADD lift-handle-gear-1 32270 black
CONNECT lift-handle-axle-1.axle1 -> lift-worm-handle-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
CONNECT lift-handle-axle-1.axle2 -> lift-handle-gear-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Adds the rear handwheel that turns the worm shaft to adjust and hold the boom height.
STEP 42
GROUP cab-outer-trim
ADD cab-trim-axlepin-2 43093 blue
ADD cab-trim-spacer-2 18654 white
CONNECT cab-trim-axlepin-2.pin1 -> cab-trim-spacer-2.hole1 STIFF
WHY Starts the second cab trim assembly with a white spacer below its axle pin.
STEP 43
ADD cab-trim-3 32449 mediumazure
ADD cab-trim-4 32449 mediumazure
CONNECT cab-trim-axlepin-2.axle1 -> cab-trim-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT cab-trim-axlepin-2.axle1 -> cab-trim-4.axlehole1 LOCKED
WHY Stacks the two blue trim strips on the axle end above the white spacer.
STEP 44
ADD cab-trim-longpin-1 42924 blue
ADD cab-trim-longpin-2 42924 blue
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-1.pin2~ -> cab-trim-3.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-1.pin2~ -> cab-trim-4.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-2.pin2~ -> cab-trim-3.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-2.pin2~ -> cab-trim-4.hole2 STIFF
WHY Adds the pair of long friction pins that will mount the white side panel and secure the trim.
STEP 45
ADD cab-side-panel-1 11947 white
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-1.pin3 -> cab-side-panel-1.hole1~ STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-2.pin3 -> cab-side-panel-1.hole2~ STIFF
END
WHY Fits the white side panel over the projecting blue pins to finish the outer cab trim.
STEP 46
ATTACH cab-outer-trim
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-1.pin1 -> front-steering-connector-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT cab-trim-longpin-2.pin1 -> front-steering-connector-1.hole2 STIFF
WHY Fastens the completed blue-and-white panel to the outer white connector beside the cab.
STEP 47
GROUP boom-tip-link
ADD boom-tip-beam-1 32316 white
ADD boom-tip-pin-1 39888 tan
ADD boom-tip-pin-2 39888 tan
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-1.pin1 -> boom-tip-beam-1.hole2 TURNS
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-2.pin1 -> boom-tip-beam-1.hole4 TURNS
END
ATTACH boom-tip-link
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-1.pin2 -> boom-main-beam-1.hole13 TURNS
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-2.pin2 -> steering-bearing-2.hole1 TURNS
WHY Joins the boom tip to the long leveling link with two free pivots so the fork carrier can tilt.
STEP 48
GROUP fork-carrier
ADD fork-tine-1 32316 black
ADD fork-pin-1 61332 black
ADD fork-pin-2 61332 black
CONNECT fork-pin-1.pin1 -> fork-tine-1.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT fork-pin-2.pin1 -> fork-tine-1.hole5 STIFF
WHY Starts the first fork tine with two adjacent friction pins at its heel.
STEP 49
ADD fork-upright-1 32140 black
CONNECT fork-pin-1.pin2 -> fork-upright-1.hole4~ STIFF
CONNECT fork-pin-2.pin2 -> fork-upright-1.hole3~ STIFF
WHY Secures the first upright to the fork tine with two pins so the heel cannot rotate.
STEP 50
ADD fork-top-axle-1 4519 lightgray
ADD fork-longpin-1 42924 blue
ADD fork-longpin-2 42924 blue
CONNECT fork-top-axle-1.axle1 -> fork-upright-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT fork-longpin-1.pin1 -> fork-upright-1.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT fork-longpin-2.pin1 -> fork-upright-1.hole2 STIFF
WHY Adds the upper tilt axle and two cross pins to tie the fork carrier together.
STEP 51
ADD fork-crosspiece-1 60484 black
ADD fork-longpin-3 42924 blue
CONNECT fork-longpin-1.pin2 -> fork-crosspiece-1.hole3 STIFF
CONNECT fork-longpin-2.pin2 -> fork-crosspiece-1.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT fork-longpin-3.pin1 -> fork-crosspiece-1.hole1~ STIFF
WHY Slides the T-shaped crosspiece over the fork pins and adds the outward pin for the other tip link.
STEP 52
ADD fork-upright-2 32140 black
CONNECT fork-longpin-1.pin3 -> fork-upright-2.hole1 STIFF
CONNECT fork-longpin-2.pin3 -> fork-upright-2.hole2 STIFF
WHY Adds the second upright in the opposite orientation to form a stiff fork carrier.
STEP 53
ADD fork-tine-2 32316 black
ADD fork-pin-3 61332 black
ADD fork-pin-4 61332 black
CONNECT fork-pin-3.pin1 -> fork-upright-2.hole4~ STIFF
CONNECT fork-pin-4.pin1 -> fork-upright-2.hole3~ STIFF
CONNECT fork-pin-3.pin2 -> fork-tine-2.hole4 STIFF
CONNECT fork-pin-4.pin2 -> fork-tine-2.hole5 STIFF
END
WHY Fastens the second fork tine parallel to the first with its heel held by two friction pins.
STEP 54
ATTACH fork-carrier
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-1.pin3 -> fork-crosspiece-1.hole5~ TURNS
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-2.pin3 -> fork-crosspiece-1.hole2~ TURNS
WHY Hinges the completed fork carrier to the boom-tip linkage while leaving the tines free to tilt.
STEP 55
ADD boom-tip-beam-2 32316 white
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-1.pin3 -> boom-tip-beam-2.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT boom-tip-pin-2.pin3 -> boom-tip-beam-2.hole3 TURNS
CONNECT fork-longpin-3.pin2 -> boom-tip-beam-2.hole5 STIFF
