CONNECT fork-tilt-crossaxle-1.axle4 -> fork-tilt-bush-2.axlehole1 LOCKED
END
ATTACH fork-tilt-control
CONNECT fork-top-axle-1.axle3~ -> fork-tilt-cheek-2.hole1 TURNS
